By swift and accurate stroke, you chop off the predatory branch adhered to Irene. Then you grab her shoulders, pull back, and both of you fall powerlessly on the grass, gasping for air. Irene embraces you tightly, shaking in sobs. So you sit on the ground, holding each other, trying not to think about the gruesome fate that you miraculously managed to escape. Irene sobs louder and cuddles tighter up to you. You wipe her tears, feeling a strange emotion.